<title>USA: Beltrami Cty HRA, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Beltrami Cty HRA, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc said it won $5 million of Belt rami County Housing Redevelopment Authority, Minn., lease revenue bonds, series 1996, and with a true interest cost of 6.295 percent.</p>
</text>
